      "code": "#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nclass Solution {\nprivate:\n    int calcWays(int n) {\n        if (n == 0 || n == 1)\n            return 1;\n        return calcWays(n - 1) + calcWays(n - 2);\n    }\npublic:\n    int climbStairs(int n) {\n        return calcWays(n);\n    }\n};",
