      "completeness": "complete",
      "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <vector>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nclass Solution {\nprivate:\n    vector<int> memo;\n    int calcWays(int n) {\n        if (n == 0 || n == 1)\n            return 1;\n        if (memo[n] == -1)\n            memo[n] = calcWays(n - 1) + calcWays(n - 2);\n        return memo[n];\n    }\n\npublic:\n    int climbStairs(int n) {\n        memo = vector<int>(n + 1, -1);\n        return calcWays(n);\n    }\n};",
